{"seq":3,"slug":"organometallic-catalysis","title":"有机金属化学与催化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/inorganic-chemistry/applications-frontiers/organometallic-catalysis","wordCount":1735,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"有机金属化学与催化\">有机金属化学与催化</h1><p>你手机外壳的塑料、药瓶里的药物分子、农田里的化肥，背后几乎都站着一个共同的功臣——金属与碳直接成键的有机金属化合物，它们驱动着现代合成工业的催化循环。这一篇是金属有机化学与催化机理的详讲处，直接衔接<a href=\"../coordination-chemistry/complex-reactions-isomerism\">配合物的反应与异构现象</a>里的取代与电子转移，把它们组装成完整的催化循环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>有机金属化合物的定义是含至少一个金属—碳键。它们的稳定性常用十八电子规则预测：当中心金属的价电子（金属 d 电子加各配体贡献的电子）总数达到 18 时，恰好填满 9 条价轨道（一条 s、三条 p、五条 d），体系特别稳定，类似主族的八隅体。羰基（CO）、烯烃、环戊二烯基（Cp）是最常见的有机金属配体，它们既给电子（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 给体）又能接受金属回授电子（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 受体）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[金属-碳键&lt;br/&gt;有机金属化合物] --&gt; B[十八电子规则]&#10;  B --&gt; C[配体电子计数]&#10;  A --&gt; D[基元步骤]&#10;  D --&gt; E[氧化加成 / 还原消除]&#10;  D --&gt; F[配体配位 / 解离]&#10;  D --&gt; G[迁移插入]&#10;  E --&gt; H[催化循环]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[均相催化]&#10;  H --&gt; J[多相催化 / MOF]\">flowchart TD\n  A[金属-碳键&lt;br/&gt;有机金属化合物] --&gt; B[十八电子规则]\n  B --&gt; C[配体电子计数]\n  A --&gt; D[基元步骤]\n  D --&gt; E[氧化加成 / 还原消除]\n  D --&gt; F[配体配位 / 解离]\n  D --&gt; G[迁移插入]\n  E --&gt; H[催化循环]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[均相催化]\n  H --&gt; J[多相催化 / MOF]</pre><h2 id=\"配体的电子计数与反馈键\">配体的电子计数与反馈键</h2><p>理解有机金属化学的第一步是数电子。配体按给电子数分类：CO、膦（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>PR</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PR}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、卤素（X，离子法记 2 个）各算两电子给体，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>η</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-Cp 算五（中性法）或六（离子法）电子，烯烃算两电子。金属—羰基键尤其精妙——CO 先用碳上孤对向金属空轨道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 给电子，金属再把充满的 d 电子回授到 CO 的空 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反键轨道，即「反馈 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 键」。这种协同成键大幅强化金属—配体键、削弱 C—O 键，可由红外光谱中 C—O 伸缩频率的降低直接观测。反馈键的本质正是<a href=\"../coordination-chemistry/crystal-field-ligand-field-theory\">晶体场与配位场理论</a>中配位场理论解释强场配体的同一机制。</p>\n<p>下表小结常见配体的电子贡献（中性计数法）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配体</th>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>给电子数</th>\n<th>成键特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>羰基</td>\n<td>CO</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 给 + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 反馈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>膦</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>PR</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PR}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 给，可调电子/位阻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>氢</td>\n<td>H</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>端基氢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环戊二烯基</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>η</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-Cp</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>面配位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>烯烃</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C}_2\\text{H}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 配位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"催化循环的基元步骤\">催化循环的基元步骤</h2><p>均相催化的威力在于把困难反应拆成若干温和的基元步骤，金属在其间反复变价、变配位数。氧化加成：一个 A—B 分子断裂加到金属上，金属氧化态与配位数各加 2。还原消除：逆过程，把两个配体偶联放出产物，金属氧化态降 2，这是催化循环吐出产物、再生催化剂的关键。配位与解离：底物上、产物下。迁移插入：一个配体插入金属—配体键之间，是链增长的核心步骤。</p>\n<p>把这些步骤首尾相接就是催化循环。例如钯催化的交叉偶联（2010 年诺贝尔化学奖的 Suzuki、Negishi、Heck 反应）大体是「氧化加成→转金属化→还原消除」三步成环，把两个有机片段精准拼接，已成制药与材料合成的标准工具。这些基元步骤本质上都是配位数与氧化态的变化，是<a href=\"../coordination-chemistry/complex-reactions-isomerism\">配合物的反应与异构现象</a>中取代与氧化还原机理的有机金属版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"均相催化的代表反应\">均相催化的代表反应</h2><p>均相催化剂溶于反应介质，选择性高、机理清晰。工业上的标杆包括：用钴或铑配合物的氢甲酰化（烯烃加 CO 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{H}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 得醛）、用 Ziegler–Natta 或茂金属催化剂的烯烃聚合（造就聚乙烯、聚丙烯）、用钌卡宾的烯烃复分解（2005 年诺贝尔化学奖）。不对称催化更是高峰——手性金属配合物能选择性生成单一对映体，正是<a href=\"../coordination-chemistry/complex-reactions-isomerism\">配合物的反应与异构现象</a>中手性的催化价值在制药工业的兑现。当代趋势是用储量丰富的第一过渡系金属（铁、钴、镍）替代昂贵的铂族贵金属，并结合光催化与电催化降低能耗（<a href=\"https://www.biochemjournal.com/archives/2025.v9.i9.C.5553/a-comprehensive-review-on-organometallic-catalysis-in-modern-organic-synthesis-bridging-inorganic-design-and-sustainable-organic-applications\">生物医学期刊综述, 2025</a>）。2025 年还报道了一种活性可比酶的铱有机金属催化剂用于 NADH 再生，最大转化频率达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13090</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>h</mtext><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13090\\ \\text{h}^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13090</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">h</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，创有机金属催化纪录（<a href=\"https://pubs.acs.org/doi/10.1021/acscatal.5c02162\">ACS Catalysis, 2025</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多相催化与金属有机框架\">多相催化与金属有机框架</h2><p>多相催化剂与反应物处于不同相（通常固体催化液相或气相反应），便于分离回收。从汽车尾气三元催化到费托合成，多相催化是化工产能的主力。前沿方向是把均相催化的精准与多相催化的可回收结合，金属有机框架（MOF）正是理想载体——其规则孔道可锚定金属活性位、限域底物以提高选择性。据 2025 年综述，锆基与钯基 MOF 在 Suzuki–Miyaura 等交叉偶联中表现出色，可在温和条件下高效催化并便于回收（<a href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-025-20149-9\">Scientific Reports, 2025</a>）。MOF 的结构与孔道设计本身属<a href=\"solid-state-materials-inorganic\">固体与材料无机化学</a>，本篇只关注其催化角色，二者在此分工互补。</p>\n<h2 id=\"茂金属与多重键的化学\">茂金属与多重键的化学</h2><p>有机金属化学中最具标志性的分子是二茂铁——铁夹在两片环戊二烯基之间像三明治，开启了「夹心化合物」这一整个家族，其发现者获 1973 年诺贝尔化学奖。二茂铁恰好满足十八电子规则、异常稳定、可逆氧化还原，被广泛用作电化学参比、抗爆添加剂与功能材料构筑单元。把环戊二烯基换成苯、把铁换成其它金属，可衍生出庞大的茂金属库，其中第四族茂金属（茂锆、茂钛）是现代烯烃聚合的明星催化剂。</p>\n<p>另一前沿是金属—配体多重键：金属卡宾（M=C）与金属卡拜（M≡C）是烯烃复分解与多种 C—H 活化的活性中心，而金属—金属多重键（最高可达五重键）则把成键理论推向极限，是理解多核簇合物的钥匙。这些超越简单金属—碳单键的结构，把有机金属化学从「金属挂个有机基团」提升为系统的成键理论，也为设计下一代催化剂提供了分子工具箱。它们的反应活性最终都回到<a href=\"../coordination-chemistry/complex-reactions-isomerism\">配合物的反应与异构现象</a>中氧化态与配位数变化的基本框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>有机金属化合物含金属—碳键，稳定性常用十八电子规则预测，配体按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 给/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 受分类。</li>\n<li>金属—羰基的反馈 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 键与配位场理论同源，可由红外 C—O 频率观测。</li>\n<li>催化循环由氧化加成、还原消除、配位解离、迁移插入等基元步骤组装，是配位机理的有机金属版。</li>\n<li>均相催化（交叉偶联、复分解、不对称催化）与 MOF 多相催化是当代前沿，趋势是廉价金属与绿色活化。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"有机金属化学与催化","id":"有机金属化学与催化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"配体的电子计数与反馈键","id":"配体的电子计数与反馈键"},{"level":2,"text":"催化循环的基元步骤","id":"催化循环的基元步骤"},{"level":2,"text":"均相催化的代表反应","id":"均相催化的代表反应"},{"level":2,"text":"多相催化与金属有机框架","id":"多相催化与金属有机框架"},{"level":2,"text":"茂金属与多重键的化学","id":"茂金属与多重键的化学"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"生物无机化学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/inorganic-chemistry/applications-frontiers/bioinorganic-chemistry"},"next":null}